01:44:03,938 --> 01:44:06,038
- They always do.
- They go so well together.

2547
01:44:06,668 --> 01:44:09,677
Whenever I went to an old-fashioned western food restaurant as a kid...

2548
01:44:09,678 --> 01:44:10,837
- At a pork cutlet restaurant...
- they always served kkakdugi...

2549
01:44:10,838 --> 01:44:12,238
- Kkakdugi?
- with the pork cutlet.

2550
01:44:12,638 --> 01:44:15,148
(Spicy kkakdugi to cut through the richness)

2551
01:44:16,348 --> 01:44:18,278
(After a bite of crispy pork cutlet, )

2552
01:44:19,948 --> 01:44:21,848
(a bite of spicy and crunchy kkakdugi)

2553
01:44:22,618 --> 01:44:25,688
(It's the kind of flavor that you keep reaching for.)

2554
01:44:26,288 --> 01:44:27,588
(Humming)

2555
01:44:28,188 --> 01:44:30,058
The kkakdugi is also good.

2556
01:44:30,258 --> 01:44:31,898
Yoon Seo, your salad is good too.

2557
01:44:32,428 --> 01:44:34,568
Even though the sauce is store-bought.

2558
01:44:35,068 --> 01:44:36,137
It's delicious.

2559
01:44:36,138 --> 01:44:37,138
(She's so cute.)

2560
01:44:37,938 --> 01:44:41,168
(When you eat some big, crisp leaf of lettuce, )

2561
01:44:42,038 --> 01:44:45,008
(a refreshing crunch brightens up your palate.)

2562
01:44:46,478 --> 01:44:50,977
(Pairing perfectly with the pork cutlet)

2563
01:44:50,978 --> 01:44:54,848
(A light, fresh vegetable salad)

2564
01:44:55,018 --> 01:44:57,787
Of course. It takes a lot of work. Yoon Seo worked hard.

2565
01:44:57,788 --> 01:44:59,628
(The older siblings are completely satisfied.)

2566
01:45:00,488 --> 01:45:05,758
(All the perfect sides that make the pork cutlet shine even more)

2567
01:45:05,928 --> 01:45:07,627
Yoon Seo plated the food so beautifully.

2568
01:45:07,628 --> 01:45:08,628
Right.

2569
01:45:08,629 --> 01:45:11,398
It's my first time plating pork cutlet at home...

2570
01:45:11,798 --> 01:45:15,338
like something straight out of a restaurant.

2571
01:45:15,838 --> 01:45:17,637
- I find it so pretty.
- I agree.

2572
01:45:17,638 --> 01:45:19,137
(The siblings' meal is a joy for both the eyes and the taste buds.)

2573
01:45:19,138 --> 01:45:20,207
- It's my first time.
- Me too.

2574
01:45:20,208 --> 01:45:21,807
- It's the first time in my life.
- We don't do this at home.

2575
01:45:21,808 --> 01:45:23,017
It won't happen again.

2576
01:45:23,018 --> 01:45:25,018
