2577
01:45:25,518 --> 01:45:27,418
Eating it like this makes me feel good.

2578
01:45:28,118 --> 01:45:29,287
(Gosh, I'm so happy.)

2579
01:45:29,288 --> 01:45:31,588
I'd be happy if I could sleep in tomorrow.

2580
01:45:32,488 --> 01:45:34,388
- I'm full.
- What are we doing tomorrow?

2581
01:45:35,228 --> 01:45:36,468
Tomorrow, you're heading out...

2582
01:45:36,998 --> 01:45:38,798
- to work before dawn.
- At what time?

2583
01:45:39,258 --> 01:45:41,127
You'll leave here at 5:30am.

2584
01:45:41,128 --> 01:45:42,168
I see.

2585
01:45:42,498 --> 01:45:44,137
- Are we leaving at 5:30am?
- Yes.

2586
01:45:44,138 --> 01:45:45,198
Oh, my gosh.

2587
01:45:46,908 --> 01:45:48,107
At 5:30am?

2588
01:45:48,108 --> 01:45:49,368
(Labor early in the morning?)

2589
01:45:49,878 --> 01:45:51,378
If we're leaving at 5:30am,

2590
01:45:51,938 --> 01:45:53,277
we'll have to wake up at 4:50am.

2591
01:45:53,278 --> 01:45:54,607
(Suddenly, they have to wake up early.)

2592
01:45:54,608 --> 01:45:56,518
What time is it now?

2593
01:45:57,218 --> 01:45:58,418
It's 10:20pm.

2594
01:45:59,348 --> 01:46:00,418
What?

2595
01:46:02,717 --> 01:46:05,387
