2603
01:46:24,907 --> 01:46:26,787
(No matter how hard they try, it's impossible.)

2604
01:46:26,907 --> 01:46:28,627
(Will this be the siblings' first failure?)

2605
01:46:28,947 --> 01:46:31,147
