2606
01:46:31,877 --> 01:46:33,037
(Catching them with one hand)

2607
01:46:33,317 --> 01:46:34,563
(Snatching them up in an instant)

2608
01:46:34,587 --> 01:46:35,907
(Ji Jin Hee, an excellent worker)

2609
01:46:36,017 --> 01:46:37,017
He's a good worker.

2610
01:46:37,018 --> 01:46:38,787
