2611
01:46:38,957 --> 01:46:41,087
(He's incredibly shy around strangers.)

2612
01:46:41,857 --> 01:46:42,857
(Compliment 1)

2613
01:46:43,257 --> 01:46:44,257
(Compliment 2)

2614
01:46:44,697 --> 01:46:45,697
(Compliment 3)

2615
01:46:45,927 --> 01:46:46,927
(Compliment 4)

2616
01:46:47,997 --> 01:46:50,237
(Getting completely drained by all the compliments)

2617
01:46:50,837 --> 01:46:52,437
(He needs to recharge.)

2618
01:46:53,107 --> 01:46:55,967
(What better way to recover than with some eel?)

2619
01:46:56,337 --> 01:46:59,607
(Real-time recharging)

2620
01:47:00,107 --> 01:47:01,477
(This is art.)

2621
01:47:02,007 --> 01:47:03,447
(Energy level at maximum)

2622
01:47:04,077 --> 01:47:06,117
